[{"client_msg_id":"773c4ff8-fc16-4265-b407-1d9cd28558c1","type":"message","user":"U023H98P3N0","text":"NLゴールドの条件が年50万だったら作ってましたね。\nEPOSゴールド持ってるんですが、そちらも最近は年50万円の決済額に到達してないし、いっそtsumiki証券の口座作ることも検討中。","ts":"1626397970.434600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4BbL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"44e20aaf-a832-4c43-9974-3653f8a72f9d","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"引っ越し前なら高い家賃をクレカ引き落とししてたから半年かからなかったんだけどタイミングが悪い","ts":"1626397928.433700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7DX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"182f526b-8ec7-45ad-be2e-2c60f1245524","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"gadgetについてクレカの保険使うためにNLゴールドへの移行ができないから100万無理・・・","ts":"1626397903.432800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uwC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e56a2077-d6d1-4bbb-8cc2-6136ec53856a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ゴールド、いまちょっと厳しいな","ts":"1626397848.431100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u9aN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"92e57a38-8786-4dd3-9aee-629095603771","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"自分は癖のないProxyとおもってるのでいいんだけど","ts":"1626397827.430700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J89J2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"439caf99-1892-4461-aed8-517a5b5329fd","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"悪くなったというか、基準が明確になったという感じですね\nただできれば上限がなければ低くてもよかったんだけどな...","ts":"1626397816.430300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZMi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed7a22b9-adad-4723-ba0b-617033293701","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"（そんな悪くなってたんだ）","ts":"1626397787.429600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text"