T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XTAVt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"150a34e9-c545-4afb-859f-381b0c297526","type":"message","user":"U0238G3KV8D","text":"\u003chttps://www.smbc-card.com/camp/00012/index.jsp\u003e\n先日こちらで教えてもらったSBIのカード積立を設定しました\n設定上限が月5万円で、キャンペーン中はポイント1.5%つくので、最大で月750円プラスになる感じです","ts":"1626396860.422900","attachments":[{"fallback":"三井住友カード: 【三井住友カード×SBI証券】投信積立でポイントが貯まるおススメのクレジットカード｜クレジットカードの三井住友VISA カード","id":1,"title":"【三井住友カード×SBI証券】投信積立でポイントが貯まるおススメのクレジットカード｜クレジットカードの三井住友VISA カード","title_link":"https://www.smbc-card.com/camp/00012/index.jsp","text":"三井住友カードとSBI証券が投信積立でVポイントが貯まるおススメのクレジットカード。資産運用するなら現金よりもポイントがもらえるクレカ積立がおトク！キャンペーン期間中の還元率は最大3％！即時発行なら最短5分で積立投資を始められます。","thumb_url":"https://www.smbc-card.com/common/responsive/img/ogimage.gif","blocks":null,"service_name":"三井住友カード","service_icon":"https://www.smbc-card.com/static/responsive/img/favicon.ico","thumb_width":1100,"thumb_height":578,"from_url":"https://www.smbc-card.com/camp/00012/index.jsp","original_url":"https://www.smbc-card.com/camp/00012/index.jsp"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2uYJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"791c6cc1-cc71-433c-be03-928b03728d96","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"すごい...","ts":"1626394400.419100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2HAf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f907b28-a968-42e0-8aed-a1e4dfb0cd08","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"なんかすげぇ","ts":"1626393444.418900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B=UO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c82c68cd-84a1-4c55-aa02-93dfe481a469","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/chiastolite/status/1415653066330624000?s=19|https://twitter.com/chiastolite/status/1415653066330624000\u003e","ts":"1626393440.418600","attachme